Sar Barehna Fatima Ki Betiyan Roti Rahi<br>
Phool Se Shanou Me Badhkar Rassiyan Roti Rahi<br>
<br>
1.Nange Paa Bimar Ku Kantou Pa Chalwayaga<br>
Zakhmi Pairou Se Lipat Kar Bedhiyan Roti Rahi<br>
<br>
2.Laasha-e-Abbas Khaime Me Nahin Laaye Hussain<br>
Khoon Bhare Parcham Se Lipti Bebiyan Roti Rahi<br>
<br>
3.Berida Kufe Ke Bazarou Me Jab Laayi Gayi<br>
Dhaaph Kar Baalou Se Muh Shehazadiyan Roti Rahi<br>
<br>
4.Dasht Me Besheer Zindan Me Sakina Chodh Gayi<br>
Kukh Ujdhi Maa Ke Laabou Par Looriyan Roti Rahi<br>
<br>
5.Chodh Kar Qabre Sakina Jab Chale Alhe Haram<br>
Shaam Ke Zindan Ki Tarikiyan Roti Rahi<br>
<br>
6.Fatima Sughra Ku Zainab Kuch Na De Payi Jawab<br>
Bus Dikha Ke Usku Dhurou Ke Nasha Roti Rahi<br>
<br>
7.Umme Laila Ke Muqaddar Me Na Tha Fakhri Sukoon<br>
Zandagi Bhar Sunke Awaaz-e-Azaan Roti Rahi
